[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/312821397","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/29669#issuecomment-312821397","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/29669","id":312821397,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMxMjgyMTM5Nw==","user":{"login":"VVD","id":482751,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4Mjc1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/482751?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD","html_url":"https://github.com/VVD","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VVD/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-07-04T08:54:52Z","updated_at":"2017-07-04T09:00:08Z","body":"I made workaround (dirty hack):\r\n```\r\n--- rails-4.2.9.orig/actionpack/lib/action_dispatch/journey/router/utils.rb\r\n+++ rails-4.2.9/actionpack/lib/action_dispatch/journey/router/utils.rb\r\n@@ -13,13 +13,13 @@\r\n         #   normalize_path(\"\")      # => \"/\"\r\n         #   normalize_path(\"/%ab\")  # => \"/%AB\"\r\n         def self.normalize_path(path)\r\n-          encoding = path.encoding\r\n+          encoding = Encoding::UTF_8\r\n           path = \"/#{path}\"\r\n           path.squeeze!('/')\r\n           path.sub!(%r{/+\\Z}, '')\r\n           path.gsub!(/(%[a-f0-9]{2})/) { $1.upcase }\r\n           path = \"/\" if path == \"\".freeze\r\n           path.force_encoding(encoding)\r\n           path\r\n         end\r\n```","author_