":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/deployments","created_at":"2008-04-11T02:19:47Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T07:43:35Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T03:40:43Z","git_url":"git://github.com/rails/rails.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:rails/rails.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails","homepage":"https://rubyonrails.org","size":275235,"stargazers_count":57965,"watchers_count":57965,"language":"Ruby","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":22063,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1385,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["activejob","activerecord","framework","html","mvc","rails","ruby"],"visibility":"public","forks":22063,"open_issues":1385,"watchers":57965,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/pulls/29660","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/pull/29660","diff_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/pull/29660.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/pull/29660.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Summary\r\n\r\nissue: https://github.com/rails/rails/pull/29624\r\nconversation: https://github.com/rails/rails/pull/29626\r\nrelated: https://github.com/rails/rails/pull/29062\r\n\r\n### Other Information\r\n\r\nI'm not 100% sure...\r\n\r\nFirst of all, I thought of fixing [ActionController::StrongParameters#params](https://github.com/rails/rails/blob/bdc73a438a97f2e0aceeb745f4a95f95514c4aa6/actionpack/lib/action_controller/metal/strong_parameters.rb#L1059) to force_encoding the values to UTF-8.\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/actionpack/lib/action_controller/metal/strong_parameters.rb b/actionpack/lib/action_controller/metal/strong_parameters.rb\r\nindex a1b8b7cd6e..4a23f7496c 100644\r\n--- a/actionpack/lib/action_controller/metal/strong_parameters.rb\r\n+++ b/actionpack/lib/action_controller/metal/strong_parameters.rb\r\n@@ -1070,7 +1070,13 @@ module StrongParameters\r\n     # Returns a new ActionController::Parameters object that\r\n     # has been instantiated with the <tt>request.parameters</tt>.\r\n     def params\r\n-      @_params ||= Parameters.new(request.parameters)\r\n+      @_params ||= begin\r\n+        prm = request.parameters.transform_values do |v|\r\n+          v.is_a?(String) ? v.force_encoding(Encoding::UTF_8) : v\r\n+        end\r\n+\r\n+        Parameters.new(prm)\r\n+      end\r\n     end\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut, some test cases expect `ActionController::StrongParameters` not to change the encoding...\r\n\r\n```\r\n  1) Failure:\r\nParameterEncodingTest#test_does_not_raise_an_error_when_passed_a_param_declared_as_ASCII-8BIT_that_contains_invalid_bytes [/Users/ttanimichi/ghq/github.com/rails/rails/actionpack/test/controller/parameter_encoding_test.rb:48]:\r\nExpected: \"ASCII-8BIT\"\r\n  Actual: \"UTF-8\"\r\n\r\n\r\n  2) Failure:\r\nParameterEncodingTest#test_properly_encodes_ASCII_8BIT_parameters_into_binary [/Users/ttanimichi/ghq/github.com/rails/rails/actionpack/test/controller/parameter_encoding_test.rb:34]:\r\nExpected: \"ASCII-8BIT\"\r\n  Actual: \"UTF-8\"\r\n\r\n\r\n  3) Failure:\r\nParameterEncodingTest#test_properly_encodes_all_ASCII_8BIT_parameters_into_binary [/Users/ttanimichi/ghq/github.com/rails/rails/actionpack/test/controller/parameter_encoding_test.rb:41]:\r\nExpected: [\"ASCII-8BIT\"]\r\n  Actual: [\"UTF-8\"]\r\n\r\n3082 runs, 14987 assertions, 3 failures, 0 errors, 0 skips\r\n```\r\n\r\nNext, I thought of fixing [ActionDispatch::Http::Parameters#path_parameters](https://github.com/rails/rails/blob/c2e0fc3216eae6187e0ed0985b513dbd2d99cfd9/actionpack/lib/action_dispatch/http/parameters.rb#L80) .\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/actionpack/lib/action_dispatch/http/parameters.rb b/actionpack/lib/action_dispatch/http/parameters.rb\r\nindex 8b2753dfc8..112244edb6 100644\r\n--- a/actionpack/lib/action_dispatch/http/parameters.rb\r\n+++ b/actionpack/lib/action_dispatch/http/parameters.rb\r\n@@ -78,9 +78,15 @@ def path_parameters=(parameters) #:nodoc:\r\n       #\r\n       #   {'action' => 'my_action', 'controller' => 'my_controller'}\r\n       def path_parameters\r\n-        get_header(PARAMETERS_KEY) || set_header(PARAMETERS_KEY, {})\r\n+        params = get_header(PARAMETERS_KEY) || set_header(PARAMETERS_KEY, {})\r\n+        ActionDispatch::Request::Utils.each_param_value(params) do |param|\r\n+          param.force_encoding ::Encoding::UTF_8\r\n+        end\r\n+        params\r\n       end\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut, some test cases expect `path_parameters` not to change the encoding...\r\n\r\n```\r\n  1) Failure:\r\nLegacyRouteSetTests#test_route_with_text_default [/Users/ttanimichi/ghq/github.com/rails/rails/actionpack/test/controller/routing_test.rb:664]:\r\n--- expected\r\n+++ actual\r\n@@ -1 +1 @@\r\n-{:controller=>\"content\", :action=>\"show_page\", :id=>\"\\xD1\\x82\\xD0\\xB5\\xD0\\xBA\\xD1\\x81\\xD1\\x82\"}\r\n+{:id=>\"текст\", :controller=>\"content\", :action=>\"show_page\"}\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  2) Failure:\r\nTestInvalidUrls#test_invalid_UTF-8_encoding_is_treated_as_ASCII_8BIT_encode [/Users/ttanimichi/ghq/github.com/rails/rails/actionpack/test/dispatch/routing_test.rb:4438]:\r\nExpected response to be a <404: missing>, but was a <500: Internal Server Error>\r\nResponse body: 500 Internal Server Error\r\nIf you are the administrator of this website, then please read this web application's log file and/or the web server's log file to find out what went wrong..\r\nExpected: 404\r\n  Actual: 500\r\n\r\n3084 runs, 14986 assertions, 2 failures, 0 errors, 0 skips\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn the end, I have fixed [ActionDispatch::Http::Parameters#parameters](https://github.com/rails/rails/blob/c2e0fc3216eae6187e0ed0985b513dbd2d99cfd9/actionpack/lib/action_dispatch/http/parameters.rb#L48) because this method handles the encoding like [this](https://github.com/rails/rails/blob/c2e0fc3216eae6187e0ed0985b513dbd2d99cfd9/actionpack/lib/action_dispatch/http/parameters.rb#L58). This change passed all test cases. But I'm not 100% sure...","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/29660/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/29660/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1149782028,"node_id":"MDE1Ok1pbGVzdG9uZWRFdmVudDExNDk3ODIwMjg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/events/1149782028","actor":{"login":"eileencodes","id":1080678,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODA2Nzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1080678?v=4","grav